  "decision": "REJECT",
  "fix_description": "Both findings are fixable. Fix 1: replace the hardcoded SECRET with a value from an environment variable (e.g., os.environ['JWT_SECRET']) and fail fast if it is missing or weak; never hardcode secrets in source. Fix 2: remove the insecure 'none' algorithm from the allowed algorithms list, keeping only strong HMAC/RSA options (e.g., algorithms=['HS256']) and reject tokens that attempt alg='none'.",
